======================================================================
  CHECK 5: v9_statistical_methods.py — MASE y_train Source Audit
======================================================================
  The script uses marts_features_{freq}.csv (FAIR dataset) for ALL models.
  This means Expert models have MASE computed with FAIR y_train.
  → If base y_train has HIGHER naive MAE, Expert MASE would be LOWER.
  → This is a CONFOUND, not a real improvement!

  --- 15m ---
  Fair y_train: 14,684 samples
  Base y_train: 19,102 samples
